  "body": "### Summary\nFollow-up of #780 (the weekly deck generator). The round-3 Fable review left one Low and three details. None of them shows in today's deck: LOT-176 is the only dropped lot, and it is not on those slides.\n\n### Scope\n1. **Low**: in `tooling/roadmap/weekly/build.py:589` (`slide_m5`), the M5 feature cards list lots from `G.rows` without filtering. A lot closed as not planned would still be listed, above a pill that excludes it. Fix: build the list through `C.live_lots(…, G.rows, DROPPED)`, as `card_pill` does.\n2. In `build.py:292` (`dependents`), a dropped lot still counts in « débloque N ». Fix: iterate over live lots only.\n3. In `scripts/tests/test_roadmap.py:578`, only `live_lots` is covered. Add tests that fail when the filter is removed from `card_pill`, `left_card` or `ms_lots`.\n4. In `build.py:594`, the « Aussi dans M5 · 0 » card renders empty when every remaining M5 lot is listed. Hide it in that case.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Tests first, then the fixes.\n- [ ] Render a deck with four lots simulated as not planned: every slide agrees.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
